{"id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-representable.md","title":"Representable","display":"df-representable — Representable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-representable","aliases":["57-df-representable"],"display":"df-representable — Representable","depends_on":["[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-provable]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-numeral]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable — Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" href=\"?note=973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" title=\"57-df-provable\">57-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 扩展 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a> 的算术语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。固定互异变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 和证明系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x]\">\\(\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x]\\)</span> 为同时把各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 的自由出现替换为闭数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline{n_i}\">\\(\\underline{n_i}\\)</span>，数码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\\)</span> 是下式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> 定义的表示性谓词，理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>、变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 及证明系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 均使用上述固定环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的正向充要式定义；这里没有把它改成还要求逐项证明否定式的更强表示性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"973e8f8c36bdfa9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anc